    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Shakshuka is a one-pan dish that needs nothing more than good bread alongside. The key is getting the sauce deep and flavourful before the eggs go in."}]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {"level": 2},
